// ============================================================================
// Query: Secure Score Trend Analysis
// Purpose: Daily Microsoft Secure Score / Defender for Cloud Secure Score
// trend, for the Executive dashboard trend graph.
// Table: SecureScores (Defender for Cloud data connector)
// Parameters (workbook-bound): {TimeRange}
// ============================================================================
SecureScores
| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}
| summarize
    CurrentScore = arg_max(TimeGenerated, CurrentScore),
    MaxScore = arg_max(TimeGenerated, MaxScore)
    by Day = bin(TimeGenerated, 1d)
| extend SecureScorePercentage = round(100.0 * CurrentScore / MaxScore, 1)
| project Day, CurrentScore, MaxScore, SecureScorePercentage
| sort by Day asc
